FerrionOS change to Zed (crates/crashes, GPL-3.0-or-later, kept), made against release v1.29.3, commit d01b134cddf5e4f71964deb2d6f81cdb38fcf1e7:
- crash-handler and minidumper do not build for this target. There, crates/crashes compiles src/unsupported.rs, which keeps the same interface and records nothing.

